window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Nobody ever said that ruling would be easy.</b></p> <p>With the annexation of Yamato and Yoshika crowned as the empress of Jiaguo, their abilities as rulers are put to the test. At home, Jia and Yue must contend with suitors from Qin, including a familiar face and a truly unexpected offer from on high. Abroad, Eui once more returns to Goryeo to solidify alliances and support Eunae's upcoming ascension. Meanwhile, the children are growing up fast and looking to prove themselves as worthy successors to their superlative \"big sisters.\" It's all too much for one person, but with her friends—and her selves—for support, Yoshika rises to the challenge.</p> <p>Join the girls in the first part of the epic conclusion to their progression fantasy adventure about friendship, love, self-discovery, personal growth, and—lest we forget—magical martial arts!</p>"; 
